# The build context of every other Dockerfile in this folder (agentfield, swe-af, pr-af, modelstub, gitstub) is this
# folder, DENIED BY DEFAULT: only what a Dockerfile COPYs is named. codeaf.Dockerfile has its own list beside it
# (codeaf.Dockerfile.dockerignore), which BuildKit reads in place of this one for that file.
*
!scripts
!modelstub
!gitstub
!codeaf-local

# LAST, so that it wins inside the folders allowed above.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/.ssh
**/.aws
**/.codeaf
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
